{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "episode": "ESSY-0002",
  "series": "ESSY",
  "subtype": "essay",
  "title": "When the Future Suddenly Becomes Visible",
  "language": "en",
  "renderMode": "essay-narration",
  "voice": {
    "provider": "edge",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "-12%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz",
    "volume": "+0%"
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "n001",
      "heading": "N001",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n001",
          "text": "My father had already gone to bed when he remembered that he still needed to take his medication.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n002",
      "heading": "N002",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n002",
          "text": "In the moment, there wasn't much time to think.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n003",
      "heading": "N003",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n003",
          "text": "After lying down for a while, he looked more like himself again. The immediate problem had passed.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n004",
      "heading": "N004",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n004",
          "text": "We all know that our parents will grow old.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n005",
      "heading": "N005",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n005",
          "text": "And then there are moments when all those gradual changes suddenly become visible at once.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n006",
      "heading": "N006",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n006",
          "text": "I think much of ordinary life depends on a quiet assumption that tomorrow will be reasonably similar to today.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n007",
      "heading": "N007",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n007",
          "text": "We make plans.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n008",
      "heading": "N008",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n008",
          "text": "When a parent begins to lose some independence, the natural response is to start looking for solutions.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n009",
      "heading": "N009",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n009",
          "text": "These are practical questions, and they matter.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n010",
      "heading": "N010",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n010",
          "text": "This is uncomfortable for anyone who is used to solving problems.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n011",
      "heading": "N011",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n011",
          "text": "There is an old Buddhist idea that seems almost too obvious in ordinary language: everything changes.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n012",
      "heading": "N012",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n012",
          "text": "Our parents will still be there.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n013",
      "heading": "N013",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n013",
          "text": "That may explain those quiet moments after a small crisis has passed.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n014",
      "heading": "N014",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n014",
          "text": "The obvious response is to prepare.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n015",
      "heading": "N015",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n015",
          "text": "Perhaps this is one reason caring for aging parents can feel so overwhelming.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n016",
      "heading": "N016",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n016",
          "text": "Otherwise, responsibility can quietly expand until it becomes impossible.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n017",
      "heading": "N017",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n017",
          "text": "That sounds pessimistic, but I don't think it has to be.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n018",
      "heading": "N018",
      "narration": [
        {
          "id": "n018",
          "text": "That evening, after my father had taken his medication, he went back to bed.",
          "pauseAfterSec": 0.6
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
